Mama, we are hungry.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.310
We haven't eaten anything since yesterday.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.050
Our stomach, our stomach!

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.530
Is that so?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.030
Excuse me...

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:53.840
If you like, there is some soumen left overs at my place.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:55.940
Can we?

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:57.370
Yes. Your welcome.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.570
I'll give you my key.

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:05.150
They have it really rough, those two.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:17.920
Gooooood! Ki-chan, you're so cute!

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.040
Hey, that's dangerous, Yuki!

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:23.010
Oooh! You're putting on a good look...

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:26.370
I'm sorry!

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:29.320
See? Let's hurry back!

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.630
Okay...

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.230
Wooowww!!!

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:32.750
Hey...

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.060
This room seems to be open.

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:42.310
How careless.

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:43.500
Geez...

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:46.550
It's okay... Let's go inside.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.600
Yes.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.520
Oh my...

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:56.510
Bye then...

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:57.760
Ah...

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.040
Uhm... Asahina!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:03.890
What?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:06.240
Em... It's...

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:07.800
Well...

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.590
I mean... I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:11.000
Well...

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.850
I was wondering if you are still mad about that...

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.280
Bye.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:20.230
Yeah...

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:35.880
Why did you come here?

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.070
Oh my...

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.990
Is it so bad coming here to see my daughter's face?

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.590
If you have no business here then go home!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:46.000
Is that the way you should talk, Chizuru-san?

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:49.240
Telling me that while eating ice shavings isn't convincing at all.

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:53.330
That can't be helped. I'm a snow woman after all.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.430
Hello!

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:56.140
Haven't seen you in a long time, Kouta-san.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:57.350
Thank you...

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:58.750
Nice to see you too.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.750
Just go back to the snow mountains!

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:02.240
Well, well, Chizuru-san.

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:05.360
Then let's go to your place.

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:06.760
Guide us.

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:07.600
Eh?!

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:13.810
Tayura-kun, I'm taking this out.

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:14.330
Ok.

00:22:14.820 --> 00:22:17.320
So, why are you here?

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.910
Oh almost forgot.

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:21.080
Yukihana?

00:22:21.180 --> 00:22:22.220
Yes.

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:32.160
Take them if you please, Kouta-san.

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:33.710
Is that ok?

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:35.500
Thank you very much!

00:22:35.590 --> 00:22:37.680
What are you planning?

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:40.830
Oh no, I'm not planning anything at all.

00:22:43.700 --> 00:22:45.730
Oh my... it suits you.

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:47.150
Is that so?

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:49.110
And you look good too.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.460
It suits you, Chizuru-san.

00:22:57.590 --> 00:22:58.610
Really?

00:22:58.740 --> 00:23:01.230
Well, please go out like that tomorrow.

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:02.100
Eh?

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:04.310
There's going to be fireworks, tomorrow.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:08.120
That's right. Wow, you're really thoughtful, mother.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.460
But... you will be alone.

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:15.690
Since Kouta-san will be going with me.

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:20.010
Why did it turn out like this?! What's the meaning of this, Kouta-kun?

00:23:20.070 --> 00:23:22.050
Uh- No! HUH?!

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:24.190
Fireworks huh?

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:26.000
Ok! Me too!

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:31.340
You have promised me a long time ago, Kouta-san!

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:33.310
I did?

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:35.450
How cold, aren't we?

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.420
That's not fair, Kouta-kun!

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:42.120
Chizuru-sama, it's just as your mother said.

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:43.690
Just shut up!

00:23:43.700 --> 00:23:44.650
Kouta...

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:48.130
Hey, that wolf over there, don't hug him!

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:51.170
Ah Kouta-kun, me too!

00:23:50.810 --> 00:23:52.020
~Me too~

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:54.010
Hey! Let go of him!

00:23:55.000 --> 00:24:00.880
<b>Mirai eto tsuzuite yuku michi</b>

00:23:55.000 --> 00:24:00.880
One day we will walk on the path

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:06.740
<b>futari nara aruhi de yukeru yo</b>

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:06.740
leading to our future

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:12.640
<b>mitsume au manazashi no muku ogawa</b>

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:12.640
Our eyes meet on the pure looking stream.

00:24:12.670 --> 00:24:18.800
<b>eien no kizu naka mieru no?</b>

00:24:12.670 --> 00:24:18.800
Can you see through the everlasting wound?

00:24:25.580 --> 00:24:31.310
<b>kono basho de anata ni koishita ano toki kana</b>

00:24:25.580 --> 00:24:31.310
I wonder if this is when I fell in love with you right here

00:24:31.360 --> 00:24:36.320
<b>Sekai ga kawatta youna kiseki</b>

00:24:31.360 --> 00:24:36.320
A miracle as if the world has changed

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:43.210
<b>kono chiisana koto de kanjiraredeshi awase</b>

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:43.210
Our feelings meet through this

00:24:43.260 --> 00:24:48.110
<b>houseki wa ko taisetsu ni ageru no?</b>

00:24:43.260 --> 00:24:48.110
Are you giving me the jewel you hold so dear?

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:54.130
<b>sotto yasashi hikari ga sashikomu</b>

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:54.130
The light is softly and gently illuminating

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:59.680
<b>anata to iru ima ga tottemo ureshikute</b>

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:59.680
being with you right now makes me very happy

00:24:59.730 --> 00:25:05.550
<b>shiawase no kaze ni tsuzumareo</b>

00:24:59.730 --> 00:25:05.550
lets turn into the wind of happiness

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:11.480
<b>itsudatte anata no tonari ni</b>

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:11.480
I will always be by your side

00:25:11.620 --> 00:25:17.440
<b>donna ni mo kitto egao ni nareru yo</b>

00:25:11.620 --> 00:25:17.440
Everyday will become a smile

00:25:17.500 --> 00:25:23.270
<b>unimei no koi wo shinjitteru</b>

00:25:17.500 --> 00:25:23.270
I believe in the voice of fate
